**Verdict (pinned) — big vocab for free: BPB(H128k) − BPB(H3*-384 575M) ≤ −0.003: Δ = -0.0088 → holds.** With the proxy charged (522M branch): Δ = -0.0047 → holds.

**Verdict (pinned) — flat can't use it: BPB(F128k) − BPB(B384 matched) ≥ +0.003: Δ = +0.0495 → holds.**

**Verdict (pinned) — two-level wins at 128k: BPB(H128k) − BPB(F128k) ≤ −0.003: Δ = -0.0777 → holds.** With the proxy charged (522M branch): Δ = -0.0736 → holds.

At the 3.505e16 branches, the same differences (reported, not verdicts): H128k − H3* (3.505e16) -0.0098; F128k − B384 matched (3.505e16) +0.0797; H128k − F128k (3.505e16) -0.1222.

