## One-line answers: is the two-level head cheap AND good?

- **Equal FLOPs:** yes on BPB: at 6.717e16 training FLOPs the two-level head (H3*-384, 575M tokens) is 0.0204 BPB better than the flat head matched to the same FLOPs (mean of 2 seeds per side, Δ -0.0204).
- **Equal tokens:** no: at 300M tokens BPB(H3*) − BPB(B384) = +0.0115 (seed 0, round 11); the gap sits in targets ranked ≥ 4,096.
- **Vocabulary size:** big_vocab_for_free Δ -0.0088 (holds); flat_cant_use_it Δ +0.0495 (holds); two_level_wins_128k Δ -0.0777 (holds).

